{"unit_id":"flyinstar__dsh-qq-bridge#card-card-zh","repo":"flyinstar/dsh-qq-bridge","commit":"8d52e45198365fc9e08918b3fb64f23a2d7dc5c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"QQ Bridge 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 QQ 双向桥接插件，通过 OneBot v11 WebSocket 将 QQ 私聊和群聊接入持久化的 Harness Agent 会话，并让 DSH Agent 向 QQ 发送消息。它支持群聊触发、会话恢复、图片与表情包处理、自动复读、长期记忆和定时提醒，也提供运维工具与会话设置路由。适合希望在 QQ 中与 DSH Agent 对话或从 DSH 向 QQ 联系人、群发送内容的用户。需要运行 NapCat 等 OneBot 服务并配置 WebSocket 地址；模型凭据由 DSH 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-30","index.js:234-240","cordis.patch.yml:96-120"]}
{"unit_id":"flyinstar__dsh-qq-bridge#card-card-en","repo":"flyinstar/dsh-qq-bridge","commit":"8d52e45198365fc9e08918b3fb64f23a2d7dc5c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"QQ Bridge connects QQ chats to DSH agents over OneBot v11. Private and group messages map to persistent sessions, and agents can send text and images to QQ. It supports stickers, chat memory, and scheduled reminders. It requires NapCat or another OneBot service with a configured WebSocket endpoint.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-30","index.js:234-240","cordis.patch.yml:96-120"]}
