{"unit_id":"flyinstar__dsh-qq-bridge#feature-feature-1","repo":"flyinstar/dsh-qq-bridge","commit":"8d52e45198365fc9e08918b3fb64f23a2d7dc5c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"QQ Bridge 的功能「QQ 双向会话桥接」：将 OneBot v11 收到的私聊或群消息交给对应的持久化 Harness Agent 会话处理，并把最终文本回复发回 QQ；群触发方式可配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1-16","index.js:234-240"]}
{"unit_id":"flyinstar__dsh-qq-bridge#feature-feature-2","repo":"flyinstar/dsh-qq-bridge","commit":"8d52e45198365fc9e08918b3fb64f23a2d7dc5c2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"QQ Bridge 的功能「向 QQ 发送消息和图片」：Agent 可调用 qq_send_message 向好友或群发送文本，长消息会分段；也可调用 qq_send_image 发送本地工作目录内或 HTTP(S) 来源的图片。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:30-45","tools.js:107-135"]}
